#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<MMAP_PAGE_ZERO> (since Linux 2.4.0)"
msgstr "B<MMAP_PAGE_ZERO> (depuis Linux 2.4.0)"

#. type: Plain text
