#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Same as B<PER_LINUX32>, but implies B<ADDR_LIMIT_3GB>."
msgstr "Identique à B<PER_LINUX32>, mais implique B<ADDR_LIMIT_3GB>."

#. type: TP
